    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679230/extras/bff23f566a833f64b1dedc80dd45c718.poster.avif?t=1737317940\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679230/extras/bff23f566a833f64b1dedc80dd45c718.webm?t=1737317940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679230/extras/bff23f566a833f64b1dedc80dd45c718.mp4?t=1737317940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAVU is all about tactical combat and base building. Basic gameplay is very similiar to traditional RTS. Build a base, collect resources, upgrade units and destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the rts-style free movement of units is replaced by a tactical combat system where attacks are sent in waves against base defences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attackers can move only in a straight line forward and defenders move sideways in the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficient attack formations and defence placement are important to get most value out of your units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying enemy bases and defending your bases against waves of attacks generate resources but hard fights can cost a lot more than they give.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build multiple bases to collect resources, produce units, research upgrades and defend your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each base location has different terrain features. Some make good production bases and others are better suited for building a strong defence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information about the gameplay coming as the development of the game progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile if any of this sounds interesting, wishlists and follows are greatly appreciated.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679230/extras/bff23f566a833f64b1dedc80dd45c718.poster.avif?t=1737317940\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679230/extras/bff23f566a833f64b1dedc80dd45c718.webm?t=1737317940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679230/extras/bff23f566a833f64b1dedc80dd45c718.mp4?t=1737317940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAVU is all about tactical combat and base building. Basic gameplay is very similiar to traditional RTS. Build a base, collect resources, upgrade units and destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the rts-style free movement of units is replaced by a tactical combat system where attacks are sent in waves against base defences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attackers can move only in a straight line forward and defenders move sideways in the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficient attack formations and defence placement are important to get most value out of your units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying enemy bases and defending your bases against waves of attacks generate resources but hard fights can cost a lot more than they give.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build multiple bases to collect resources, produce units, research upgrades and defend your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each base location has different terrain features. Some make good production bases and others are better suited for building a strong defence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information about the gameplay coming as the development of the game progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile if any of this sounds interesting, wishlists and follows are greatly appreciated.</p>",
    "short_description": "TAVU is a PvE RTS game with a tactical combat system. Build your bases and defend them against waves of enemy attacks. Upgrade your units and destroy enemy bases to gain new territories and resources.",
